Command Injection and Execution Vulnerabilities The use of subprocess to execute compiler commands with user-provided input can lead to command injection if inputs are not properly sanitized., Insecure File Handling Writing user-provided content to a temporary file without validation can lead to file system manipulation or exposure of sensitive data.

